<title>UK: TABLE-Kalon yr pretax, payout rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kalon yr pretax, payout rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.11		   vs 5.21</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.5		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.2		    vs 4.8</p>
<p> Pretax, preexceps	34.7		   vs 22.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   524.8		  vs 374.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Fast-growing British paint and building chemicals manufacturer Kalon Group Plc said the results demonstrated continuing improvement in the its performance.</p>
